<title>USA: Strong storm to move across Northern Europe - WSC.</title>
<headline>Strong storm to move across Northern Europe - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A strong storm system would move eastward across Benelux, northwest Germany and Denmark during Wednesday, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Shipping in the Bay of Biscay, the English Channel and the southern North Sea will can expect strong winds during this period.</p>
<p>Coastal beach erosion was also expected for northwest France and the southern British Isles as strong northwest winds pound the coast.</p>
</text>
